entries.content:
Mood shows the current state of the character's morale under accumulated stress.

An Affliction is one of the states a hero can enter upon reaching 100 stress, the other being a Virtue. An Affliction shows much often than Virtue, about 70% to 30%. Once the hero gets one of the statuses, it locked until the stress is lowered and the hero shifts back to neutral state. For example - if the hero gets a FEARFULL state, they will locked on FEARFULL until their stress drops below 100, and then they can switch to a NEUTRAL state.

Afflicted heroes will suffer from madness clouding their minds introducing them into one of the states:

Fearful: hero will start to fear for their lives and panic at the slightest danger;
Paranoid: hero will start to see danger in even insignificant trifles, suspecting even their friends and comrades in the threat to their lives;
Selfish: hero will fixate on their own persona, caring only about their well-being and ignoring others;
Masochistic: hero will start looking for pain and danger, even refusing to treat wounds, which can lead to disastrous consequences;
Abusive: hero will begin to insult their comrades for the slightest oversight often breaking into unreasonable aggression;
Hopeless: hero will lose all hope of salvation and the will to live;
Irrational: the hero will go insane and begin to talk utter nonsense, often unrelated to reality in any way.

Virtuous heroes will have some buffs depending on their state, reducing their stress and stress of the party, or buff their teammates. While being Virtuous, the hero refuses to succumb to madness , which will lead to one of the following statuses:

Stalwart: hero will find enough strength in themself to continue to live and fight regardless of any wounds;
Courageous: hero will find enough determination in themself to fight against any dangers, ignoring their fear;
Focused: hero's mind will enter the mode of total concentration on the task in order to achieve guaranteed success;
Powerful: hero will find more strength in themself to destroy their enemies;
Vigorous: hero will discover hidden reserves in themself in order to give their best in spite of any fatigue.

Neutral is a normal state of hero's mind that is active only when stress is less in the range from 0 to 99, and will be replaced by one of the other statuses after reaching 100.
